{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790438330397,"sessionID":"ses_f21913b60ffeVd14r6mZ3n2isy","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_495a45276d0d451094774c92","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Explore codebase structure","prompt":"Explore the codebase in /workspace thoroughly. I need to understand:\n1. The directory structure (especially res://data/units/, res://custom_nodes/, res://scenes/battle_unit/)\n2. The contents of any existing files in these directories\n3. Whether Team enum exists anywhere and what values it has\n4. Whether UnitStats class exists already\n5. Whether BattleUnit class exists already\n6. Whether detect_range.gd or target_finder.gd already exist\n7. The contents of battle_unit.tscn and battle_unit.gd\n\nReturn all file contents and paths found.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_f2190ceb5ffew73KSKaebQrvWX\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nHere is a complete report of all findings.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Directory Structure\n\n```\n/workspace/\n├── .godot/                          (Godot editor cache/metadata)\n│   ├── global_script_class_cache.cfg\n│   └── editor/\n├── data/\n│   ├── enemies/\n│   │   └── zombie.tres\n│   └── units/\n│       ├── unit_stats.gd\n│       ├── unit_stats.gd.uid\n│       └── bjorn.tres\n├── scenes/\n│   ├── battle_unit/\n│   │   ├── battle_unit.gd\n│   │   ├── battle_unit.gd.uid\n│   │   └── battle_unit.tscn\n│   └── main.tscn\n├── scripts/                         (empty directory)\n├── project.godot\n└── task_config.json\n```\n\n**Notable absences:**\n- There is **no** `/workspace/custom_nodes/` directory at all.\n- There are **no** `detect_range.gd` or `target_finder.gd` files anywhere in the workspace.\n- The `/workspace/scripts/` directory exists but is empty.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Contents of All Existing Files\n\n### `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd`\n**Path:** `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd`\n\n```gdscript\nclass_name UnitStats\nextends Resource\n\nenum Team {PLAYER, ENEMY}\n\nconst MAX_ATTACK_RANGE := 5\n\n@export var team: Team\n@export_range(1, MAX_ATTACK_RANGE) var attack_range: int = 1\n```\n\n### `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd.uid`\n**Path:** `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd.uid`\n\n```\nuid://6g3nmkgoab16\n```\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/data/units/bjorn.tres` (player unit stats resource)\n**Path:** `/workspace/data/units/bjorn.tres`\n\n```\n[gd_resource type=\"Resource\" script_class=\"UnitStats\" load_steps=2 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://data/units/unit_stats.gd\" id=\"1_unit_stats\"]\n\n[resource]\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_unit_stats\")\nteam = 0\nattack_range = 2\n```\n- `team = 0` -- this corresponds to `Team.PLAYER` (0-based enum, first value).\n\n### `/workspace/data/enemies/zombie.tres` (enemy unit stats resource)\n**Path:** `/workspace/data/enemies/zombie.tres`\n\n```\n[gd_resource type=\"Resource\" script_class=\"UnitStats\" load_steps=2 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://data/units/unit_stats.gd\" id=\"1_unit_stats\"]\n\n[resource]\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_unit_stats\")\nteam = 1\nattack_range = 1\n```\n- `team = 1` -- this corresponds to `Team.ENEMY` (0-based enum, second value).\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd`\n**Path:** `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd`\n\n```gdscript\nclass_name BattleUnit\nextends Area2D\n\n@export var stats: UnitStats: set = _set_stats\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tif stats:\n\t\t_set_stats(stats)\n\n\nfunc _set_stats(value: UnitStats) -> void:\n\tstats = value\n\t\n\tif not stats or not is_node_ready():\n\t\treturn\n\t\n\tstats = value.duplicate()\n\tcollision_layer = stats.team + 1\n```\n\n### `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd.uid`\n**Path:** `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd.uid`\n\n```\nuid://co1dno2t5o6ga\n```\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn`\n**Path:** `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn`\n\n```\n[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd\" id=\"1_battle_unit\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Resource\" path=\"res://data/units/bjorn.tres\" id=\"2_stats\"]\n\n[sub_resource type=\"RectangleShape2D\" id=\"1_body_shape\"]\nsize = Vector2(24, 24)\n\n[node name=\"BattleUnit\" type=\"Area2D\"]\ncollision_mask = 0\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")\nstats = ExtResource(\"2_stats\")\n\n[node name=\"CollisionShape2D\" type=\"CollisionShape2D\" parent=\".\"]\nshape = SubResource(\"1_body_shape\")\n```\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/scenes/main.tscn`\n**Path:** `/workspace/scenes/main.tscn`\n\n```\n[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"PackedScene\" path=\"res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn\" id=\"1_battle_unit\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Resource\" path=\"res://data/units/bjorn.tres\" id=\"2_player_stats\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Resource\" path=\"res://data/enemies/zombie.tres\" id=\"3_enemy_stats\"]\n\n[node name=\"Main\" type=\"Node2D\"]\n\n[node name=\"Flagship\" parent=\".\" groups=[\"fleet_a\"] instance=ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")]\nposition = Vector2(0, 0)\nstats = ExtResource(\"2_player_stats\")\n\n[node name=\"EnemyShipNear\" parent=\".\" groups=[\"fleet_b\"] instance=ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")]\nposition = Vector2(60, 0)\nstats = ExtResource(\"3_enemy_stats\")\n\n[node name=\"EnemyShipFar\" parent=\".\" groups=[\"fleet_b\"] instance=ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")]\nposition = Vector2(125, 0)\nstats = ExtResource(\"3_enemy_stats\")\n```\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/project.godot`\n**Path:** `/workspace/project.godot`\n\n```\nconfig_version=5\n\n[application]\nconfig/name=\"Detect Range Target Finder\"\nconfig/description=\"Minimal autobattler targeting task derived from the GodotGameLab combat-preparation tutorial\"\nrun/main_scene=\"res://scenes/main.tscn\"\nconfig/features=PackedStringArray(\"4.4\")\n\n[rendering]\nrenderer/rendering_method=\"gl_compatibility\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/task_config.json`\n**Path:** `/workspace/task_config.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement the fleet radar target acquisition setup ...\"\n}\n```\n(Full instruction text included in the earlier read output.)\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/.godot/global_script_class_cache.cfg`\n**Path:** `/workspace/.godot/global_script_class_cache.cfg`\n\n```\nlist=[{\n\"base\": &\"Area2D\",\n\"class\": &\"BattleUnit\",\n\"icon\": \"\",\n\"is_abstract\": false,\n\"is_tool\": false,\n\"language\": &\"GDScript\",\n\"path\": \"res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd\"\n}, {\n\"base\": &\"Resource\",\n\"class\": &\"UnitStats\",\n\"icon\": \"\",\n\"is_abstract\": false,\n\"is_tool\": false,\n\"language\": &\"GDScript\",\n\"path\": \"res://data/units/unit_stats.gd\"\n}]\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. Team Enum -- Exists and Its Values\n\n**Yes, the `Team` enum exists.** It is defined inside `UnitStats` at `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd` (line 4):\n\n```gdscript\nenum Team {PLAYER, ENEMY}\n```\n\nIts values are:\n| Name    | Ordinal (int) |\n|---------|---------------|\n| `PLAYER` | `0`          |\n| `ENEMY`  | `1`          |\n\nThis is confirmed by the resource files:\n- `bjorn.tres` uses `team = 0` (PLAYER)\n- `zombie.tres` uses `team = 1` (ENEMY)\n\n---\n\n## 4. UnitStats Class -- Already Exists\n\n**Yes.** Defined in `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd`:\n\n- `class_name UnitStats`\n- `extends Resource`\n- Contains the `Team` enum and exported properties `team` (type `Team`) and `attack_range` (int, 1-5).\n- **Missing:** There is no `TARGET` constant yet (the task requires `const TARGET = { Team.PLAYER: \"fleet_b\", Team.ENEMY: \"fleet_a\" }`).\n\n---\n\n## 5. BattleUnit Class -- Already Exists\n\n**Yes.** Defined in `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd`:\n\n- `class_name BattleUnit`\n- `extends Area2D`\n- Has an exported `stats: UnitStats` with a setter `_set_stats()`, and a `_ready()` that calls the setter.\n- **Missing:** No `detect_range` or `target_finder` onready variables yet.\n\n---\n\n## 6. detect_range.gd and target_finder.gd -- Do NOT Exist\n\n- `/workspace/custom_nodes/` directory does not exist.\n- Glob searches for `**/detect_range*` and `**/target_finder*` returned no results.\n- Neither file exists anywhere in the workspace.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Summary of Current State vs. Task Requirements\n\n| Required Component | Status |\n|---|---|\n| `res://data/units/unit_stats.gd` with `Team` enum | **Exists** but missing `TARGET` constant |\n| `res://custom_nodes/detect_range.gd` | **Does not exist** -- directory and file need to be created |\n| `res://custom_nodes/target_finder.gd` | **Does not exist** -- directory and file need to be created |\n| `res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn` with `DetectRange` + `TargetFinder` children | **Exists** but missing those two child nodes |\n| `res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd` with `detect_range` and `target_finder` onready vars | **Exists** but missing those variables and stats wiring |\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f21913b60ffeVd14r6mZ3n2isy","sessionId":"ses_f2190ceb5ffew73KSKaebQrvWX","model":{"modelID":"deepseek-v4-pro","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Explore codebase structure","time":{"start":1790438224206,"end":1790438330382}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_d2be5e18-b0d9-48e7-b5b5-8d5b9e2ccd6a"}},"id":"prt_0de6f31410010Bx2F7M75bGjPd","sessionID":"ses_f21913b60ffeVd14r6mZ3n2isy","messageID":"msg_0de6ec70d0010zKAz9oWizaN6t"}}
